<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND TOUR OPENER ABANDONED DUE TO RAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND TOUR OPENER ABANDONED DUE TO RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW PLYMOUTH, New Zealand 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>England's one-day cricket match against a New Zealand Academy XI was abandoned due to rain on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Academy XI 201 from 40.4 overs (C.McMillan 58, G.Loveridge 54, A. Caddick 3-44)</p>
